/* ===================== *
 *      Riftblade        *
 * ===================== */
@1101 = ~riftblade~
@1102 = ~Riftblade~
@1103 = ~Riftblade:

The Riftblade is a warrior who has learned to bend the boundaries of space and harness the forces that lie beyond the mortal plane. Rather than relying solely on physical prowess, the Riftblade manipulates dimensional energy to traverse the battlefield, empower their weapons and temporarily remove enemies from reality.
The kit combines exceptional mobility with magical weapon disruption, selective battlefield control and specialized resistance against otherworldly creatures. Its strength lies in controlling the engagement: appearing where least expected, weakening dangerous opponents and protecting itself against the very forces it commands.

Advantages:
- 1st level: May use Rift Step once per day, gaining an additional use at level 3 and every 3 levels thereafter.

Rift Step:
The Riftblade briefly tears open the fabric of space and steps through the resulting rift, instantly appearing at a selected location.

- 4th level: May use Rift Strike once per day, gaining one additional use every 4 levels thereafter.

Rift Strike:
The Riftblade draws dimensional energy along <PRO_HISHER> weapon, making each blow resonate through the planes. 
For 3 rounds, melee attacks by the Riftblade deal an additional 1d6 magic damage and reduce the targets movement speed by 25%

- 8th level: Rift Strike bonus damage increased to 2d4.
- 10th level: May use the Dimensional Prison ability once per day, gaining an additional use every 5 levels therafter.

Dimensional Prison:
The Riftblade folds space around an enemy, enclosing them within a sphere of dimensional energy.
For 1 turn, the target is enclosed in an invulnerable globe of shimmering force if they fail a saving throw vs. spells at a -2 penalty (allies don't get a save).
Hence, the creature caught inside the globe is completely safe from all attacks, but at the same time completely unable to affect the outside world.

- 13th level: Rift Strike bonus damage increased to 2d6.

- 15th level: Gains the Dimensional Anchor passive ability.

Dimensional Anchor:
The Riftblade binds <PRO_HISHER> essence to the material plane, resisting forces that would tear <PRO_HIMHER> away. The Riftblade is permanently immune to involuntary teleportation and dimensional displacement, Maze, and Imprisonment.

- High-Level Abilities: May learn the Rift Rend and Eternal Rift high level abilities.

Rift Rend:
The Riftblade delivers a devastating melee strike with <PRO_HISHER> next successful melee attack. Struck target is trapped in a dimensional labyrinth for several rounds as per the Maze spell.
This effect bypasses weapon protection spells such as Protection From Magical Weapons (requires EEex).

Eternal Rift:
The Riftblade delivers a final strike with <PRO_HISHER> next successful melee attack. Struck target is permanetly trapped in an eternal prison beyond the boundaries of the material plane as per the Imprisonment spell.
This effect bypasses weapon protection spells such as Protection From Magical Weapons (requires EEex)

Requires: Rift Rend.

Disadvantages:
- d8 hit dice.
- May not learn the Whirlwind and Greater Whirlwind high level abilities.~

